iGQs _P VImYz AWdfh">Another nice, neat and clean veg South Indian restaura=
nt in T Nagar! Waiters wear a hair stopper mat to ensure hair from falling =
in the food! Much appreciated!

The place is very clean and well maintained and it's a pleasure to eat simp=
le food here.

A major plus is the available parking which makes it convenient to visit th=
is branch of Sangeetha.
Since it was late afternoon, I asked for mini idlis or what they call Madra=
s idlis. About 8 small idlis come in a plate with ghee clad sambhar. The ta=
ste is nice and fresh. Each mini idli is like a bite full of rice!

Since Chennai is famous for tayir vada (dahi vada), I never miss an opportu=
nity to have a plate of that as well. Soft vada soaked in creamy curd comes=
 served cold along with bundis. Again an awesome tasting thing.=20

Both items are enough to fill your stomach until the next meal and all for =
Rs. 120 only!
